  "steps": [
    "Cook the ragda: in a cooker, add soaked white channa, tomato, garlic and all spices. Cook for 4–5 whistles until soft.",
    "Finish the ragda: mash lightly, add garam masala and chopped coriander. Keep slightly thick.",
    "Prepare patties mix: boil soya chunks, squeeze water and blend with oats, onion, coriander, sesame seeds, jeera and spices into a coarse mixture.",
    "Shape & coat: divide the mixture into 4 patties and coat lightly with breadcrumbs.",
    "Cook patties: pan-fry the patties using 1 tsp oil until golden and crisp.",
    "Assemble: add 1 serving ragda in a bowl, place 2 patties, top with yoghurt, chutneys, onions and sev. Serve hot."
